164 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Impact of the Project This project is designed to have a significant impact on the way people access and understand heart health information. By using an AI-powered chatbot, users can gain immediate access to reliable medical advice, reducing their dependence on healthcare providers for initial consultations. This is particularly important for individuals living in remote areas or for those who may not have access to regular medical care.)
/E (Impact of the Project This project is designed to have a significant impact on the way people access and understand heart health information. By using an AI-powered chatbot, users can gain immediate access to reliable medical advice, reducing their dependence on healthcare providers for initial consultations. This is particularly important for individuals living in remote areas or for those who may not have access to regular medical care.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
165 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (The chatbot also promotes patient education and engagement, empowering users to take a more active role in managing their heart health. By offering personalized, accurate information, the chatbot can help users make informed decisions about their lifestyle, health habits, and when to seek medical attention. This could potentially lead to better health outcomes, especially for those at risk of developing cardiovascular diseases.)
/E (The chatbot also promotes patient education and engagement, empowering users to take a more active role in managing their heart health. By offering personalized, accurate information, the chatbot can help users make informed decisions about their lifestyle, health habits, and when to seek medical attention. This could potentially lead to better health outcomes, especially for those at risk of developing cardiovascular diseases.)
