/T (Moreover, the integration of the BioMistral LLM and the RAG framework showcases the potential of AI in healthcare applications. As more AI-driven solutions are developed, the ability to offer specialized, reliable, and user-friendly tools for patient education and support will continue to grow. This project serves as a demonstration of how AI technology can be leveraged to address critical health concerns, improving access to medical information and contributing to better global health outcomes.)
