168 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The primary goal of this project is to develop a sophisticated Medical Chatbot leveraging the power of the BioMistral Large Language Model \(LLM\) and using a heart health-related PDF document as the core knowledge base. This chatbot is designed to provide accurate, context-aware responses to queries about heart health by employing an advanced technique known as Retrieval-Augmented Generation \(RAG\).)
/Alt ()
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
169 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The BioMistral LLM is an open-source language model that is particularly well-suited for handling medical text and specialized terminologies. Medical fields, especially cardiology, involve the use of complex and highly specific language, making it necessary to use a model like BioMistral, which has been optimized for processing this type of information. The LLM allows the chatbot to manage a broad spectrum of inquiries related to heart health, including prevention measures, potential treatments, symptoms of heart diseases, diagnosis guidance, and general heart health advice.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
170 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The chatbot accesses a heart health PDF document as its primary knowledge source, ensuring that the responses are grounded in credible, documented medical information. By combining this robust knowledge base with the capabilities of BioMistral, the chatbot can ensure the accuracy and reliability of the information it provides to users.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
