173 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (The healthcare industry is increasingly embracing AI-driven solutions to make medical information more accessible. There is a growing need for medical chatbots that can provide real-time assistance to individuals seeking reliable health information. Heart health is one of the most crucial areas of healthcare, as cardiovascular diseases remain one of the leading causes of death globally. Many people require timely access to trusted medical advice regarding heart disease prevention, symptoms, and treatment, but often face barriers to accessing healthcare professionals.)
/E (The healthcare industry is increasingly embracing AI-driven solutions to make medical information more accessible. There is a growing need for medical chatbots that can provide real-time assistance to individuals seeking reliable health information. Heart health is one of the most crucial areas of healthcare, as cardiovascular diseases remain one of the leading causes of death globally. Many people require timely access to trusted medical advice regarding heart disease prevention, symptoms, and treatment, but often face barriers to accessing healthcare professionals.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
174 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (This project addresses the need for accurate, trustworthy, and easily accessible heart health information by developing a user-friendly chatbot that can provide real-time assistance. The chatbot aims to: Improve Accessibility: By making heart health information available in a conversational format, the chatbot lowers the barrier to medical advice, making it more accessible to people who may not have immediate access to healthcare professionals. Reduce Information Gaps: The chatbot provides a bridge between users and the complex medical literature, helping users understand detailed medical information in an easily digestible manner. Enhance User Experience: With a focus on natural language understanding, the chatbot offers a smooth, interactive experience, allowing users to ask questions in a conversational style and receive clear, informative answers.)
/E (This project addresses the need for accurate, trustworthy, and easily accessible heart health information by developing a user-friendly chatbot that can provide real-time assistance. The chatbot aims to: Improve Accessibility: By making heart health information available in a conversational format, the chatbot lowers the barrier to medical advice, making it more accessible to people who may not have immediate access to healthcare professionals. Reduce Information Gaps: The chatbot provides a bridge between users and the complex medical literature, helping users understand detailed medical information in an easily digestible manner. Enhance User Experience: With a focus on natural language understanding, the chatbot offers a smooth, interactive experience, allowing users to ask questions in a conversational style and receive clear, informative answers.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
