/ActualText (Answer:  The heart is a muscular organ that pumps blood through the circulatory system. It is located in the chest, just behind and slightly left of the breastbone \(sternum\). The size of the heart varies depending on the person's age, sex, and overall health. In general, it is about the size of a fist.)
